{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2022-04-27 09:40:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT OF VIOLET SISTOVARIS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND. , APRIL 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXPERIENCE OFFICER VIOLET SISTOVARIS IS RETIRING AFTER 28 YEARS WITH THE COMPANY.'}